OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FOrkney will have a dry day with
OL,6,Flong sunny spells. Shetland may catch
OL,7,Fa light shower at first, then cloud
OL,8,Fbreaking to allow sunny spells.
OL,9,FSouthwesterly winds will gradually
OL,10,Ffreshen.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FDry through the evening with
OL,13,Fsome clear spells at first but
OL,14,Fincreasing high-level cloud and
OL,15,Ffreshening southwest winds. Remaining
OL,16,Fdry over night with rather breezy
OL,17,Fconditions for Shetland.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
