OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CMonday:FDry throughout the day on
OL,6,FMonday with sunshine somewhat hazy in
OL,7,Fthe morning but becoming increasingly
OL,8,Fsunny in the afternoon. Likely
OL,9,Fcloudier again in the evening. Fresh
OL,10,Fsoutherly winds.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:
OL,13,FTurning widely cloudier on Tuesday and
OL,14,Frather breezy, with an increasing risk
OL,15,Fof rain later. Remaining cloudy with
OL,16,Fsome rain on Wednesday. Bright spells
OL,17,Fand showers on Thursday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
